{"book":"Psalms","chapter":93,"translation":"KJV","url":"/bible/psalms/93","verses":[{"verse":1,"text":"The Lord reigneth, he is clothed with majesty; the Lord is clothed with strength, wherewith he hath girded himself: the world also is stablished, that it cannot be moved.","words":[["The Lord",["H3068"]],["reigneth,",["H4427"]],["he is clothed",["H3847"]],["with majesty;",["H1348"]],["the Lord",["H3068"]],["is clothed",["H3847"]],["with strength,",["H5797"]],["wherewith he hath girded",["H247"]],["himself: the world",["H8398"]],["also is stablished,",["H3559"]],["that it cannot be moved.",[]]]},{"verse":2,"text":"Thy throne is established of old: thou art from everlasting.","words":[["Thy throne",["H3678"]],["is established",["H3559"]],["of old:",["H227"]],["thou art from everlasting.",[]]]},{"verse":3,"text":"The floods have lifted up, O Lord, the floods have lifted up their voice; the floods lift up their waves.","words":[["The floods",["H5104"]],["have lifted up,",["H5375"]],["O Lord,",["H3068"]],["the floods",["H5104"]],["have lifted up",["H5375"]],["their voice;",["H6963"]],["the floods",["H5104"]],["lift up",["H5375"]],["their waves.",[]]]},{"verse":4,"text":"The Lord on high is mightier than the noise of many waters, yea, than the mighty waves of the sea.","words":[["The Lord",["H3068"]],["on high",["H4791"]],["is mightier",["H117"]],["than the noise",["H6963"]],["of many",["H7227"]],["waters,",["H4325"]],["yea, than the mighty",["H117"]],["waves",["H4867"]],["of the sea.",[]]]},{"verse":5,"text":"Thy testimonies are very sure: holiness becometh thine house, O Lord, for ever.","words":[["Thy testimonies",["H5713"]],["are very",["H3966"]],["sure:",["H539"]],["holiness",["H6944"]],["becometh",["H4998"]],["thine house,",["H1004"]],["O Lord,",["H3068"]],["for ever.",["H753"]]]}]}